{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "domain",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[凸集]]\n\n任意两点之间的整条线段都留在集合内。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nEvery segment between two points remains in the set.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "shape",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[凹凸性]]\n\n比较混合输入的值与两端输出的加权平均。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nCompare the mixed input value with the weighted endpoint outputs.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "level",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[水平集]]\n\n等于同一个输出值的输入。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nInputs sharing the same output.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "upper",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1410,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[上轮廓集]]\n\n函数值至少达到门槛的输入。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nInputs whose values meet a threshold.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "lower",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1880,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[下轮廓集]]\n\n函数值不超过门槛的输入。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nInputs whose values do not exceed a threshold.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "tangent",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 370,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[凹性一阶判据]]\n\n开凸域可微：切平面是全域上界。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nOn an open convex domain, tangent planes are global upper bounds.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "hessian",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 370,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[Hessian凹凸性判据]]\n\nC2 开凸域：Hessian 在每一点半负定。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nOn an open convex domain, every Hessian is negative semidefinite.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "implies",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 370,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[凹性推出拟凹性]]\n\n凹性保住加权平均，因此保住共同门槛。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nA concave mixture stays above the weighted average and hence any shared threshold.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "qc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1410,
      "y": 370,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[拟凹函数]]\n\n每个上轮廓集都凸。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nEvery upper contour set is convex.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "qv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1880,
      "y": 370,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[拟凸函数]]\n\n每个下轮廓集都凸。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nEvery lower contour set is convex.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "station",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 740,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[凹函数驻点全局最优]]\n\n零梯度代入切平面上界，得到全局最大。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nA zero gradient reduces the tangent bound to the stationary value.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "strict",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 740,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[严格凹与负定Hessian]]\n\n处处负定足够；严格凹不要求处处负定。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nNegative definiteness everywhere is sufficient, not necessary.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "sum",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 740,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[凹函数非负加权和]]\n\n非负权重与仿射成本保留凹性。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nNonnegative weights and affine costs preserve concavity.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "min",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1410,
      "y": 740,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[拟凹性线段判据]]\n\n混合值不低于较低的端点值。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nThe mixture is at least the lower endpoint value.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "max",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1880,
      "y": 740,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[拟凸性线段判据]]\n\n混合值不超过较高的端点值。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nThe mixture does not exceed the higher endpoint value.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "local",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1110,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[凸优化全局性]]\n\n凹目标加凸可行域：局部最大即全局最大。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nConcave objective and convex domain turn local maxima into global ones.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "exist",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 1110,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[严格凹不保证解存在]]\n\n至多一个最大点，不代表一定取得。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nAt most one maximizer does not ensure attainment.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "mixture",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 1110,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[拟凹效用与混合偏好]]\n\n同效用两端的混合不差于两端。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nA mixture of equally valued endpoints is weakly preferred to both.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "transform",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1410,
      "y": 1110,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[单调变换保持拟凹性]]\n\n非减变换保留门槛几何；严格递增保留完整排序。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nNondecreasing transformations preserve the shape; strict increase preserves ordering.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "station-bound",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1880,
      "y": 1110,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[拟凹驻点不保证最优]]\n\nx³ 在零点驻定，却没有极值。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nThe cubic is stationary at zero without an extremum.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "mono",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1480,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 125,
      "text": "## [[一维单调函数的拟凹拟凸性]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "peak",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 1480,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 125,
      "text": "## [[一维单峰函数拟凹性]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "mrs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 1480,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 125,
      "text": "## [[边际替代率]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "mrs-shape",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1410,
      "y": 1480,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 125,
      "text": "## [[拟凹效用的递减MRS]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "mono-bound",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1770,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 125,
      "text": "## [[多元单调不推拟凹]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "peak-bound",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 1770,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 125,
      "text": "## [[唯一峰值不推拟凹]]"
    }
  ],
